---
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
	title="About"
	description="About Citizen Stewardship, a nonpartisan public proposal site for civic reform discussion."
>
	<PageHero
		title="About Citizen Stewardship"
		lede="Citizen Stewardship exists to publish serious democratic reform proposals in plain language so citizens can inspect, discuss, challenge, and improve them."
	/>

	<section class="section tight">
		<div class="container content-grid">
			<div class="prose">
				<h2>What this project is</h2>
				<p>
					Citizen Stewardship is a citizen-created public proposal site. It is built around the
					idea that democratic institutions should be protected from corruption, concentrated
					private power, misinformation, and permanent political careerism.
				</p>
				<p>
					The site is intentionally nonpartisan. It does not ask readers to support a party. It
					asks readers to examine rules, safeguards, incentives, and civic duties that could help
					government answer to the public.
				</p>
				<p>
					The proposals are drafts for discussion and refinement. They should be tested against
					history, constitutional law, political feasibility, administrative complexity, civil
					liberties, and unintended consequences.
				</p>

				<h2>What this project is not</h2>
				<ul>
					<li>It is not legal advice.</li>
					<li>It is not an official government document.</li>
					<li>It is not a party platform or campaign committee.</li>
					<li>It is not a data-collection site.</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<aside class="callout">
				<h3>Operating standard</h3>
				<p>
					Good civic reform should be public, readable, accountable, legally honest, and open to
					hard criticism.
				</p>
			</aside>
		</div>
	</section>
</SiteLayout>
